  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業政策與分析",
    "sub_ename": "THE POLITICAL ECONOMY OF INDUSTRIAL POLICY",
    "describe_ch": "從政治經濟邏輯探討產業政策，以歷史視角設定近代重要主題，例如戰後美國馬歇爾計畫，日本經產省行政指導等。希望增加學生對國際組織，各國政府財經決策邏輯的了解，進而提升獨立判斷政策的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course explores industrial policy from the perspective of political economy. We will discuss important themes from a historical perspective, such as Marshall Plan and the administrative practices of the Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry of Japan. It is hoped that after completing the class, students will significantly increase their understanding of international economic organizations and the economic decision-making logic of governments, and will thereby enhance their ability to independently judge economic and industrial policies.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
